&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Weee!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Weee! is the largest and fastest-growing ethnic e-grocer in the United States, operating in one of the largest underserved categories in retail with affordable access to exciting ethnic food. By partnering with local suppliers, redesigning the value chain and leveraging social buying, Weee! is reshaping the grocery business entirely. You can read more about us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/weee-softbank-grocery-delivery-425-million-series-e-4-billion-valuation-2022-2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/e-grocer-weee-raises-425-million-funding-round-led-by-softbank-2022-02-28/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2022/02/28/weee-delivers-second-big-funding-round-in-a-year-this-time-backed-by-softbank/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Weee! is headquartered in Fremont, CA, and is currently available coast to coast with exceptional growth (5x YoY) across geographies, categories and ethnicities. We have raised $800M+ in funding to date from leading investors including &lt;a href=&quot;https://visionfund.com/portfolio&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Softbank Vision Funds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2020/08/17/weee-35-million-raise-from-dst/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;DST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, Blackstone, Tiger Global, Lightspeed Ventures, Goodwater Capital, XVC and iFly. The opportunity now is to join a rocketship as we prepare for the next stage of growth, and an eventual public listing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is onsite 5 days a week in Houston, TX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Development Associate, you will be responsible for growing the regional sales and revenue of the local marketplace. In order to do so, you will be procuring famous/popular local restaurants, bakeries and other food providers, reaching out to potential partners, closing the deal and onboard them. You are starting at an exciting time while having the opportunity to build on the momentum and work with cross-functional teams and our global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, establish relationships and engage with local restaurants and bakeries to enhance the local marketplace assortment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive GMV growth in your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify business challenges, implement strategies to expand vendor partnerships, and grow revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify strategies to expand the vendor base and grow business revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with BD manager and vendors to develop effective promotions, and take initiatives on operational improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide vendors in ensuring product listing accuracy on Weee’s platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather feedback from vendors and effectively communicate to the BD manager, technology, product, and customer service teams to improve the platform and address concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the marketing team to create compelling promotional banners and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the local operations team to ensure smooth daily activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer focused with a sales driven mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt to new situations quickly and think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at motivating potential partners to see the benefits Weee!’s local marketplace platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales experience in a fast-paced or startup environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual proficiency in Chinese and English preferred, to effectively communicate with vendor communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance package, including medical, dental, and vision.&amp;nbsp; PPO/HMO packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k, 4% company match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity and Bonus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Vacation, sick and holiday time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly mobile stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Weee! Points credits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $60,000 - $69,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may be eligible to discretionary bonus, incentives and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum base salary for new hires for the position across all US locations. Within the range, individual pay is determined by multiple factors like job-related skills, experience and work locations. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include any variable compensation elements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Weee! is an equal opportunity employer welcoming&amp;nbsp;all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status or any other basis prohibited by law.&amp;nbsp; Discrimination or harassment of any kind is not tolerated at Weee!.&amp;nbsp;If you need to inquire about an accommodation or need assistance with completing the application, please email us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:applicantaccommodation@sayweee.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;applicantaccommodation@sayweee.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more jobs and to find out more about Weee!, visit our career page: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.sayweee.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;https://about.sayweee.com/careers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://visionfund.com/portfolio&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Softbank Vision Funds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B0nGJBXSOloNJs_-pU_cPFUnQ_Lbhru6IwxvFL79mJc/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;California Employee Privacy Policy Intro/FAQ &amp;nbsp;3.19.2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fbLf8JguJ_Da11Tr9LUfUrbTX9ZiVhz5/edit&quot;&gt;Weee! Privacy Policy for California Employees Applicants Contractors (March 2026)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Weee!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Weee! is the largest and fastest-growing ethnic e-grocer in the United States, operating in one of the largest underserved categories in retail with affordable access to exciting ethnic food. By partnering with local suppliers, redesigning the value chain and leveraging social buying, Weee! is reshaping the grocery business entirely. You can read more about us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/weee-softbank-grocery-delivery-425-million-series-e-4-billion-valuation-2022-2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/e-grocer-weee-raises-425-million-funding-round-led-by-softbank-2022-02-28/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2022/02/28/weee-delivers-second-big-funding-round-in-a-year-this-time-backed-by-softbank/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Weee! is headquartered in Fremont, CA, and is currently available coast to coast with exceptional growth (5x YoY) across geographies, categories and ethnicities. We have raised $800M+ in funding to date from leading investors including &lt;a href=&quot;https://visionfund.com/portfolio&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Softbank Vision Funds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2020/08/17/weee-35-million-raise-from-dst/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;DST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, Blackstone, Tiger Global, Lightspeed Ventures, Goodwater Capital, XVC and iFly. The opportunity now is to join a rocketship as we prepare for the next stage of growth, and an eventual public listing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is onsite 5 days a week in Clifton, NJ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facility Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Facility Manager, you are responsible for making sure systems of the built environment, or facility, work harmoniously. You make sure the places in which people work, play, learn and live are safe, comfortable, productive and sustainable. You will contribute to the organization’s bottom line through your responsibility for maintaining what are often an organization’s largest and most valuable assets, such as property, buildings, equipment and other environments that house personnel, productivity, inventory and other elements of operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety and compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold OSHA, EPA and site safety standards and industry codes at both sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own fire and life safety: fire suppression, sprinkler and alarm testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share accountability for OSHA Process Safety Management (PSM) and EPA Risk Management Program (RMP) compliance for the Clifton ammonia system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce lock-out/tag-out and safe work practices; act as a HazMat responder when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Safety Data Sheet (SDS) binder at both sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance and building systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run a preventative maintenance and life-cycle program for HVAC and other facility systems to cut unplanned downtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and document daily, weekly, monthly and annual inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage racking inspections and upkeep, plus trash and cardboard compactors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and track energy efficiency and sustainability initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Powered industrial trucks (PIT)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own PIT daily safety checks, preventative maintenance, and operator training and certification at both sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refrigeration co-management (Clifton)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Chief Refrigeration Engineer on the ammonia freezer and glycol cooler systems, covering compliance, PM scheduling, budget and vendor coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and team leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the security function and the facility/maintenance team at both sites, including staffing, training and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train warehouse staff and supervisors on facility SOPs, PIT certification and emergency action procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emergency response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond quickly to alarms, system failures, shutdowns and emergencies at either site, including off-hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain plans that reduce the impact of natural disasters and other disruptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendors and budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Procure bids, negotiate and review service contracts, and manage providers across both sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and track facility budgets, expenses and maintenance costs; report regularly and drive cost-reduction initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Facilities Management, Facilities Engineering or related qualification such as project management, business management or construction management, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience in a warehouse management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a security function and a facility/maintenance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of OSHA safety, HazMat protocols and environmental compliance, including familiarity with OSHA PSM and EPA RMP for ammonia facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running PIT programs: daily safety checks, preventative maintenance, and operator training and certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facility services experience across security, fire, janitorial and equipment maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong electrical and mechanical troubleshooting skills for general facility systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing facility budgets, contracts and vendors across multiple sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner well with technical specialists on systems outside your direct scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization, attention to detail, reporting and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift up to 50 lbs, climb ladders and work in cold/freezer environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to respond to emergencies 24/7 when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of ammonia refrigeration and/or glycol cooler systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HazMat Responder certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OSHA or Food Safety certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six Sigma (Green Belt) or project management certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance package, including medical, dental, and vision.&amp;nbsp; PPO/HMO packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k, 4% company match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity and Bonus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Vacation, sick and holiday time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly mobile stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Weee! Points credits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $97,000 - $114,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may be eligible to discretionary bonus, incentives and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum base salary for new hires for the position across all US locations. Within the range, individual pay is determined by multiple factors like job-related skills, experience and work locations. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
