&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more jobs and to find out more about Weee!, visit our career page: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.sayweee.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;https://about.sayweee.com/careers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
