&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Senior Operations Manager will oversee our flagship New Jersey operation, which is the company’s largest by volume and revenue. This is a high-stakes leadership role responsible for two distinct facilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead warehouse operations across inbound, outbound, inventory, and quality control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance metrics and workflows to support rapid scaling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make data-driven decisions to identify and solve operational bottlenecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan labor needs and manage capacity during peak periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, coach, and develop supervisors, leads, and warehouse associates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on floor leadership to build high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and assign employees while maintaining accountability for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create urgency and followership across all warehouse teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master Weee!&#39;s operational systems, SOPs, and key performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inventory accuracy through physical counts and system reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan warehouse layouts, equipment maintenance, and operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage WMS and productivity systems to drive performance insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Safety&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with warehousing, shipping, and OSHA safety requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish security procedures and safety protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain flexible shift coverage for continuous operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit &amp;amp; Loss Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage operating costs including daily supplies (office/warehouse/janitorial), packaging materials, and equipment repairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cost variances and implement corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cost-efficient operations while maintaining quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Operations, Supply Chain or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years warehouse/fulfillment experience in high-volume or fast paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in a supervisory or management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Warehouse Management Systems (WMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of inventory control and cycle counting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in reducing labor costs or improving productivity metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with labor planning, scheduling and workforce optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills and strong computer proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of health and safety regulations (OSHA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual in English and Spanish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work varied schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six Sigma Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food Safety Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OSHA Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance package, including medical, dental, and vision.&amp;nbsp; PPO/HMO packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k, 4% company match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity and Bonus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Vacation, sick and holiday time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly mobile stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Weee! Points credits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $117,000 to 138,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may be eligible to discretionary bonus, incentives and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum base salary for new hires for the position across all US locations. Within the range, individual pay is determined by multiple factors like job-related skills, experience and work locations. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
